    "updated_at": "2019-10-20T07:05:29Z",
    "body": "Hi @matchai . I have a question about one of options in memory usage module. There is an option called `show_swap`. I saw its default value in the configuration document is `when total swap non-zero`. Is it true that I can set its value as `when total swap non-zero` or just a typo?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
