    "created_at": "2019-10-20T08:01:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-20T08:01:53Z",
    "body": "The default behavior is to show swap when the total swap is not `0`.\r\nThere is currently no option that is associated with that behavior, it is simply the functionality when no configuration option is provided for `show_swap`.\r\n\r\nWe should probably fix that to have an explicit option for that functionality. 🤔 ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
