    "body": "> BTW, other contributors and I finished the translation for Traditional Chinese. So, will you merge this translation to this repository, or I have to open a merge request by myself?\r\n\r\n@SLMT Oh wow! Great work!! 🙌 \r\nI'll merge #517, which contains the updated strings. All that's missing is a few of the translated configuration values here: https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/master/docs/.vuepress/config.js#L26-L42\r\n\r\nLike we've done for Japanese, those values are needed for us to complete the translation. If you can send me a code snippet with those values in Traditional Chinese I can update the site configuration to match. 😄 ",
